  "description": "A production-ready .NET 10 dotnet new template implementing a Hybrid Modular Monolith with application-owned vertical slices.\n      Includes separate Core, Application, Infrastructure, and Api projects, .NET Aspire orchestration, pre-wired modules\n      (Catalog, Identity, Orders, Notifications), a Result pattern, FluentValidation pipeline, EF Core with SQL Server,\n      executable architecture tests, and optional scripts and config files.",
