  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 - Initial release.\n      - Hybrid Modular Monolith with application-owned vertical slices for .NET 10\n      - Separate Core, Application, Infrastructure, and Api project boundaries\n      - Aspire orchestration (AppHost + ServiceDefaults)\n      - Modules: Catalog, Identity, Orders, Notifications\n      - Result pattern, FluentValidation endpoint filter, EF Core + SQL Server\n      - Architecture tests for dependency direction and slice naming rules\n      - Optional --scripts and --configs flags for mix-and-match scaffolding\n      - Short repo-files, scripts, and configs templates for app-free scaffolding",
